ja","original_title":"Like Someone in Love","overview":"Akiko jest studentką zarabiającą na studia jako dziewczyna do towarzystwa. Pewnego dnia zostaje wysłana do klienta, starego profesora Takashi, który bardziej zainteresowany jest rozmową, niż seksem. Następnego dnia dwójka spotyka zazdrosnego chłopaka Akiko. W trakcie burzliwej rozmowy Takashi oświadcza, że jest jej dziadkiem. Następne dwadzieścia cztery godziny zmieni życie dziadka i wnuczki na zawsze.","popularity":2.3124,"poster_path":"/j7mGVX3QQpr1HcO6mqdYguUoN5d.jpg","release_date":"2012-09-15","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.881,"vote_count":273,"credit_id":"6712efe598f6a758cd54edb6","department":"Writing","job":"Screenplay"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/aTUYETFiTHJHNfmjgK7T4FV3Bqh.jpg","genre_ids":[99,10751],"id":201650,"title":"...رنگ‌ها","original_language":"fa","original_title":"...رنگ‌ها","overview":"","popularity":1.2508,"poster_path":"/9guBwbGG7hW77ssNL4VlmIIWNnB.jpg","release_date":"1976-08-30","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.4,"vote_count":13,"credit_id":"679c0096acab968a584d0809","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/b9UPNXGV7mEUmLejR8caJIJijow.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":43423,"title":"Uniesie nas wiatr","original_language":"fa","original_title":"باد ما را خواهد برد","overview":"","popularity":2.6589,"poster_path":"/fBFquwGxQIXtfj8KyC8IXUAVKDd.jpg","release_date":"1999-09-12","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.101,"vote_count":199,"credit_id":"683f26d2b30306f657f2bddd","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/b9UPNXGV7mEUmLejR8caJIJijow.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":43423,"title":"Uniesie nas wiatr","original_language":"fa","original_title":"باد ما را خواهد برد","overview":"","popularity":2.6589,"poster_path":"/fBFquwGxQIXtfj8KyC8IXUAVKDd.jpg","release_date":"1999-09-12","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.101,"vote_count":199,"credit_id":"683f26dc50cc47616d7f4adc",